# Components

- Keep each component file ≤ **100 lines**. If larger, split into subcomponents or extract hooks/helpers.
- One primary responsibility per file; prefer composition over monolithic components.
- Colocate related pieces: `components/sidebar/sidebar.tsx`, `sidebar-item.tsx`, etc.
- Interactive elements (`button`, `a`, `role="button"`, clickable rows) must include Tailwind `cursor-pointer`.

```tsx
// ✅ solid (height 40px / h-10)
<button
  type="button"
  className="cursor-pointer h-10 bg-[#042954] text-white"
>
  Save
</button>

// ✅ outline (white bg, blue text + border, height 40px)
<button
  type="button"
  className="cursor-pointer h-10 border border-[#042954] bg-white text-[#042954]"
>
  Cancel
</button>

// ❌ missing cursor-pointer on actionable control
<button type="button" className="bg-[#042954] text-white">Save</button>
```
